  "namesake_notes": "Quadratus = the martyr of Carthage/Africa honoured by Augustine; Quadratus bishop of Gegi (Hippo council); Quadratus martyr of Merida (Paulus Emeritanus); consul Quadratus Apronianus; 'quadratus numerus' (square number, Isidore); Greek Kodratos in Gebhardt's index.",
